tent tattered old~
the tattered tent~
A tattered old tent lies crumpled in the corner.~
   It's a simple canvas tent with frayed edges and a constellation of moth
holes that have left it with little purpose. The tent is barely supported by
what's left of its remaining pole. Nearby, a rotting length of rope is the only
other sign that anybody else was ever here.
~
